<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alkermes upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alkermes upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen and Co analyst Ian Sanderson said he upgraded Alkermes Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- The company &quot;has great clinical milestones coming up in '97,&quot; Sanderson said.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose one to 25-7/8.</p>
</text>
